Part 2: English (informational; the Chinese version prevails)
------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Nature of license
   This project is released under an "all rights reserved + prior written
   consent" license. It is NOT an open-source license. No rights are granted
   by implication; all rights not expressly granted are reserved.

2. Allowed without prior request
   (a) viewing the publicly available code and documentation for personal
       study and research;
   (b) reporting issues or suggestions to the author via public channels
       (e.g. GitHub Issues).

3. Actions requiring prior written consent
   Without the author's prior written consent, no one may:
   (a) USE the project (including but not limited to deploying or running
       its Docker images, or reproducing the same or a similar service using
       its configuration and deployment files);
   (b) copy, distribute or publish all or any part of the code,
       documentation, strategy DSL, sample strategies or prompt templates;
   (c) modify the project or create derivative works based on it;
   (d) use the project or its derivatives for any commercial purpose
       (including paid services, embedding in commercial products, or
       providing quantitative-strategy services to third parties);
   (e) reference the project as part of, or endorsement for, one's own
       products, services, papers or promotional materials.

   To request consent, open an Issue in this repository titled
   [License Request], describing the purpose, scope and duration of the
   intended use, or contact the author through other public channels.
   Absence of an explicit written consent means NO permission is granted.

4. Third-party components
   Third-party open-source components this project depends on (Python and
   npm packages, PostgreSQL, Redis, etc.) remain under their original
   licenses; this agreement does not alter them. Trademarks and rights of
   external systems such as Ghostfolio belong to their respective owners.

5. Disclaimer
   This software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express
   or implied, including merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose
   and non-infringement. This project is a quantitative RESEARCH tool and
   does not constitute investment advice; all investment decisions, gains
   and losses are solely the user's responsibility.

6. Termination
   Any violation terminates the license automatically; the violator must
   immediately cease all use and delete all copies obtained. The author
   reserves the right to pursue legal remedies.
